WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:05.464
Someone’s going to
hang for this.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.553
Narration:
Foundation is the saga of Hari
Seldon and his followers

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.431
Narration:
on their epic quest to save
mankind.

00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:18.977
Narration:
Hari is a Mathematician who
predicts a series of crises

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:21.396
Narration:
that will result in the end of
humanity.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:27.236
Narration:
Brother Day, Brother Dusk and
Brother Dawn, known as The Empire,

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:29.404
Narrartion:
rule the galaxy with an iron
fist.

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:32.574
Our world will live on!

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:35.994
Your worlds will not.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:39.540
Narration:
The Empire don't know they're
headed for destruction.

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:43.710
Narration:
They feared Hari because he
could forecast the future.

00:00:44.211 --> 00:00:45.671
The Empire will fall.

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:48.090
Hari:
Interstellar wars will be
endless.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:51.718
Hari:
Nothing we do can prevent this.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:55.555
But we can shorten the dark ages
that follow.

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:59.226
Narration:
Hari enlists a gifted prodigy
named Gaal Dornick 

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:01.270
Narration:
to help him build The
Foundation. 

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:05.816
Narration:
A stand alone civilization that
will preserve humanity amidst the crisis.

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:10.195
Narration:
For young Gaal, the future now
rests on her shoulders.

00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:15.993
The coming generations will have
something to build upon...a
foundation.

00:01:16.702 --> 00:01:19.913
Narration:
Hari and his followers are
exiled by The Empire.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:23.750
Narration:
And sent to distant planet,
Terminus, to build The Foundation.

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:26.336
Gaal:
Terminus, I’ve never even heard
of it.

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:27.879
The seasons are extreme.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.090
Hari:
There’ll be hardships.

00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:33.552
Frozen rock, long nights, no
trees for shelter.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:37.264
Narration:
Against all odds, The
Foundation flourishes.

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:41.393
Narration:
But The Empire now fears it
could soon become obsolete.

00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:45.105
Narration:
And tensions between the two
nations become explosive.

00:01:45.856 --> 00:01:47.899
Hari:
The war with Empire is
inevitable.

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:51.445
Hari:
Because under the genetic
dynasty there is only one voice!

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:55.657
Narration:
The Empire will stop at nothing
to preserve its very existence.

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:59.578
Narration:
They'll destroy The Foundation
and anyone who supports them.

00:01:59.578 --> 00:02:04.583
♪♪

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:06.084
Narration:
We meet Salvor Hardin.

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:07.210
Who are you?

00:02:07.544 --> 00:02:09.588
Salvor Hardin...Warden of
Terminus.

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:12.215
Narration:
Her mission is to protect
The Foundation

00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:16.595
Narration:
and to preserve Hari Seldon's
plan of prosperity for this 
new generation.

00:02:17.763 --> 00:02:21.600
Narration:
But The Empire remain intent on
crushing The Foundation.

00:02:22.059 --> 00:02:23.435
Seldon!

00:02:24.561 --> 00:02:26.480
Gaal Dornick has been
reaching out to me.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:28.148
Salvor Hardin:
I have to find her.

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:31.360
Narration:
As The Foundation faces imminent
attack,

00:02:31.777 --> 00:02:34.988
Narration:
Gaal's messages lead Salvor to
go looking for her. 

00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:38.116
Narration:
And as the two women finally
meet,

00:02:38.116 --> 00:02:40.077
Narration:
the shocking truth becomes
clear.

00:02:40.744 --> 00:02:43.538
Narration:
They're from two different
generations.

00:02:44.039 --> 00:02:47.376
My name is Salvor Hardin.
I’m your daughter.

00:02:48.794 --> 00:02:49.961
Brother Day:
Threaten the peace

00:02:50.337 --> 00:02:52.381
and pay a dear price!

00:02:52.381 --> 00:02:53.298
♪♪

00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:53.924
(Grunts)

00:02:53.924 --> 00:02:56.093
♪♪

